{"ID":"20240205153714-tr5pkp5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153714-tr5pkp5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153714-tr5pkp5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112136-cucm80l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619171510-v46fekr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1526,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619171510-v46fekr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"槐花","type":"doc","updated":"20240902094312"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112136-cucm80l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112136-cucm80l","updated":"20240206112144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南、河北、山西、山东等地。\n【性状】\t皱缩而卷曲，花瓣多散落，完整者花萼钟状，黄绿色，花瓣黄色或黄白色。体轻。味微苦。花蕾 (槐米) 卵形或椭圆形。花萼黄绿色，上方为未开放的黄白色花瓣，内呈黄褐色。质轻。味微苦涩。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t凉血止血，清肝泻火。主治肠风便血，痔血，血痢，尿血，血淋，崩漏，吐血，衄血，肝火头痛，目赤肿痛，喉痹，失音，痈疽疮疡。\n【炙品】\t炒槐花：取净槐花，置预热炒制容器内，用文火加热，炒至深黄色，取出晾凉。具香气。苦寒之性缓和，并破坏了酶的活性，利于保存有效成分。其清热凉血作用弱于生品，止血作用逊于槐花炭而强于生品，用于脾胃虚弱的出血患者。\n槐花炭：取净槐花，置预热炒制容器内，用中火加热，炒至焦褐色，喷洒少许清水，灭尽火星，炒干，取出晾凉。质轻，味涩。清热凉血作用极弱，收涩之性增强，偏于止血。用于咯血、衄血、便血、痔血、崩漏下血等多种出血证。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112136-qwu1vp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112136-qwu1vp8","updated":"20240206112136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112136-f9e3mnj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162600-hzq4yxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162600-hzq4yxp","updated":"20240205162600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐花-20240205162600-wj32xeu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715150416-uek0dce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715150416-uek0dce","updated":"20240715150416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620141657-ttz9dei.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902093913-0knek8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093913-0knek8w","updated":"20240902093913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 362px;","style":"width: 352px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 1-20240715144631-ymc9lyl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 352px;\" parent-style=\"width: 362px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 850px;","style":"width: 840px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 2-20240715145006-3z1s1mp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 840px;\" parent-style=\"width: 850px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902093913-txbgffq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093913-txbgffq","updated":"20240902093913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Pr